    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIForAdapter.h#DreamUIForAdapter:Copies
    src   "Parallel to Items. An entry is null only when the panel refused that copy."
    text  "与Items平行。仅当面板拒绝了该副本时，条目才为null。"
    state machine
