DreamUIForAdapter:Items {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIForAdapter.h#DreamUIForAdapter:Items
    src   "Held, as the `each` adapter holds its items: the key a copy is kept by is the object's identity, and an\nobject let go while its copy still shows it could be replaced by a new one at the same address."
    text  "持有方式与`each`适配器持有其项相同：副本所依据的键是对象的标识，而一个\n对象在其副本仍显示它时被释放，就可能被同一地址上的新对象替换。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIForAdapter:Owner {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIForAdapter.h#DreamUIForAdapter:Owner
    src   "Weak: the owner holds this adapter, not the other way round, and a copy of the owner must never be able to\nreach back through a stale pointer into the source. DuplicateTransient on every reference for that second\nreason -- an adapter copied along with anything is inert rather than in charge of somebody else's copies."
    text  "弱引用：所有者持有此适配器，而不是反过来；所有者的副本绝不能\n通过过期指针反向访问源。基于第二个\n原因，每个引用都标记为DuplicateTransient——随任何内容一起复制的适配器是惰性的，而不是负责管理他人的副本。"
    state machine
}
